{"blocks":[{"t":"p","html":"As part of its corporate social responsibility, Robinsons Land Corporation (RLC), represented by Senior Vice President and General Manager, Arlene G. Magtibay and The City of General Trias represented by City Mayor, Antonio A. Ferrer have recently signed a Memorandum of Agreement (MOA) on recognizing the need to give Senior Citizens (SCs) and Persons with Disabilities (PWDs) additional privileges by means of free admission with zero amusement taxes. Each beneficiary is entitled to watch one 2D movie per day of availment during Mondays or Tuesdays at Movieworld branch located at Robinsons Place Gen Tri which has currently six movie houses. Present during the signing were (from left) Gen. Trias Vice Mayor Morit Sison, President Senior Citizen Group Ms. Purisima O. Arcega, Gen. Trias Mayor Antonio “Ony” Ferrer, Robinsons Malls Senior Vice President and General Manager Ms. Arlene G. Magtibay and Robinsons Malls Operations Director for Luzon Mr. Irving L. Wu."},{"t":"p","html":"<a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/700-501.html\">700-501</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-177.html\">70-177</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-178.html\">70-178</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-243.html\">70-243</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-246.html\">70-246</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-270.html\">70-270</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-346.html\">70-346</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-347.html\">70-347</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-410.html\">70-410</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-411.html\">70-411</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-412.html\">70-412</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-413.html\">70-413</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-417.html\">70-417</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-461.html\">70-461</a> <a href=\"http://www.passexamonline.com/70-462.html\">70-462</a> <a href